            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Embodiments described herein may be directed to systems, methods, apparatuses, devices, computer program products, computer-executable instructions, and/or applications for providing a remote cloud browsing session (820). A remote cloud browsing session (820) may receive a request for Internet content (314) from a user device (106, 206, 302, 804, 808), access the Internet content (314) from an Internet content source (840), and transmit second Internet content to the user device (106, 206, 302, 804, 808) based on the requested Internet content (314).</p>
            </abstract>
